WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.504 --> 00:00:10.752
Hello! Welcome to Cosmogeek Solutions. Today we will explain our ERP and Billing Software.

2
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:21.888
When stock is in one spreadsheet, invoices in another and payments in a notebook, the owner never gets a clear picture of the business.

3
00:00:22.176 --> 00:00:29.256
Our ERP and billing software connects all these departments into one system.

4
00:00:29.952 --> 00:00:35.424
First, the problems every trading and manufacturing business knows.

5
00:00:35.712 --> 00:00:43.200
Stock mismatches from separate spreadsheets, and essential items running out.

6
00:00:43.488 --> 00:00:48.888
Slow billing counters and long customer queues at peak hours.

7
00:00:49.176 --> 00:00:54.720
Mistakes in manual GST calculation, and compliance stress.

8
00:00:55.008 --> 00:01:01.584
And no real-time view of sales, outstanding dues and branch performance.

9
00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:05.424
Now let us look at the main modules.

10
00:01:05.712 --> 00:01:14.616
Inventory management: stock across warehouses, batches, low-stock alerts and transfers.

11
00:01:14.904 --> 00:01:24.072
POS and GST billing: fast barcode billing, GST invoices, receipt printing and returns.

12
00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:32.904
Sales and purchases: quotations, sales orders, purchase orders and supplier management.

13
00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:41.832
Payments and ledgers: UPI, card and cash payments, customer ledgers and credit alerts.

14
00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:48.240
Role-based access and audit logs, so you know who changed what.

15
00:01:48.528 --> 00:01:55.800
And sales, profit, stock and GST reports, with dashboards and exports.

16
00:01:56.496 --> 00:02:04.272
Here is an example. At the counter, items are added to the invoice as soon as their barcode is scanned.

17
00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:11.616
GST is calculated automatically, with the correct HSN code and tax slab.

18
00:02:11.904 --> 00:02:18.696
As soon as the bill is saved, stock is reduced in inventory, and low stock triggers an alert.

19
00:02:18.984 --> 00:02:25.872
And today's sales and outstanding payments update instantly on the owner's dashboard.

20
00:02:26.568 --> 00:02:33.312
We implement ERP in phases, so your team can adopt it comfortably.

21
00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:42.288
First, workflow mapping: understanding departments, invoice formats, tax slabs and approvals.

22
00:02:42.576 --> 00:02:47.064
Then designing the database, roles and security.

23
00:02:47.352 --> 00:02:53.520
Next, modules are built in phases, starting with the most critical one.

24
00:02:53.808 --> 00:02:59.712
Migrating existing data, and setting up printers and barcode scanners.

25
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:06.984
And finally staff training, a pilot run and go-live, along with automatic backups.

26
00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:16.992
On the technology side: React.js, Node.js, Next.js, PostgreSQL and MySQL.

27
00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:26.712
Offline billing is available when needed, so the counter keeps running without internet and syncs later.

28
00:03:27.408 --> 00:03:30.432
The benefits for your business.

29
00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:38.496
A single source of truth, with stock, sales, purchases and accounts all connected.

30
00:03:38.784 --> 00:03:43.608
Fast billing, which shortens queues at the counter.

31
00:03:43.896 --> 00:03:50.400
A GST-ready system with automatic tax calculation and GST reports.

32
00:03:50.688 --> 00:03:57.552
And better cash flow, because outstanding dues and reminders are always in view.

33
00:03:58.248 --> 00:04:08.640
Retail and wholesale billing, distributor management, manufacturing operations, multi-branch inventory, and clinic or service billing.

34
00:04:08.928 --> 00:04:18.696
This system is very useful for retail, distribution, manufacturing, healthcare, pharma and FMCG businesses.

35
00:04:19.392 --> 00:04:31.944
Want to bring your entire business into one system? Talk to Cosmogeek Solutions. We will share a demo and plan based on your workflow.

36
00:04:32.232 --> 00:04:39.696
Click Start a Project, or call or WhatsApp us. Thank you!
